  "owner_body": "- ID: `SEMANTIC-INTROSPECTION-MCP-FRONTIER.60.4.3.3.5.2.1.5.2.2.3.1.2.1.3.1.2.3.2.3.3.3.3.2.3.2.3.3.2.3.2.2.2.5.4.2.1`\n  Status: `done`\n  Goal: `Qualify every retained source fact and proposed duplicate or superseded removal before publication.`\n  Acceptance: `Bind the complete prior card and original draft to their committed revisions. Independently enumerate all source propositions, questions and removal dispositions against their richer retained homes and completed source/public join evidence. Preserve any unique boundary lost by the first draft in a superseding non-growing proposal. Reject coherent unique parser-receiver deletion and every fact/gap/question loss; authenticate the completed header join and actual result, preserve prior seals, qualify actual retention result and source/native book guidance. Leave live cards, queries and authority unchanged. Commit before current publication .2.`\n  Verification: `Whole fixed-Git original/draft/public-header/checker populations authenticate and complete source/raw/control/prior-result models reexecute. Separate ordered prose/fact/removal review preserves every declared source meaning, exact authored subtest/do-load bytes and ordered prior questions. The superseding proposal explicitly restores observer inventory and broad observer/display/frame gaps; whole-card deltas are minus4 encoded bytes/minus2 LF, with no live fact/query/authority change. Genuine per-fact/gap/question/review/body/kind loss and the draft-accepted coherent receiver deletion reject. Human semantic equivalence review is explicit; token presence is not an unrestricted semantic oracle. Actual guarded --live-unchanged --seal0 and independent whole-result0 regenerate every product and conserve all sealed bytes; typed/member/default-guard/real borrowed draft-success controls reject. Complete physical card membership/bytes and Knowledge Map authority equal committed sources. Three exact local instrument failures/programmes/results reexecute and their repairs qualify. The initial unsealed full receipt has a declared invocation-instrument gap and cannot substitute for the final result. Native retention guide/four controls, source copies and focused All tests successful Files3 Tests356 pass. Corrected matched Git evidence supersedes empty pickaxe attribution; original receipts retain. Whole source/programme/proof/native/manifest/results live in docs/audits/record-value-public-boundary-retention-20261006 and public-boundary-retention-checks-20261006. Final source refresh, claim inventory and staged doctrines/normal hooks gate this commit. Current atomic publication stays .2; every original/private/class/frame/coordinate/address/native/HIAL/visual/CI/push gap remains owned.`\n  Commit: `this semantic-retention checkpoint; resolve by work-unit Git subject`\n",
